This project contains titles and summaries from
https://github.com/openai/math (Apache License 2.0), reformatted into
JSON and into a website. We changed and derived these files. The
upstream license is included here as UPSTREAM_LICENSE. PDFs and other
originals are not mirrored; links point at the upstream repository.

This project also stores paths, hashes, and links for Lean files and
natural-language PDFs in
https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphaproof-nexus-results
at commit 0647711a71183c1ea492ad60860776617ce1ea88. Those files are not
copied into this repository. The upstream README copyright notice names
Google LLC. Code in that repository is Apache License 2.0. Other materials
are Creative Commons Attribution 4.0. Material from the OEIS is Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0. The upstream README says: "This is not
an official Google product." The organization label used here is Google
DeepMind. This atlas is not an official Google product and is not affiliated
with OpenAI or Google DeepMind.

The link-preview card uses a subset of the Liberation fonts from
https://github.com/liberationfonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1). The subset
is a modified version and does not use the reserved font name. The license
is scripts/fonts/OFL.txt.
